{"type":"message","id":"36121a25","parentId":"3e8ec04a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:16:13.117Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ZqvaNdd5LEb5cvCWNh13qX7Y|fc_02a73fafca88252d0169c909f8faf08191bc9bd2db0612314b","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/slm-inference/references/prompt-template.md","content":"# Record-grounded SLM question template\n\nUse this shape when turning retrieved patient records into a focused question for the SLM.\n\n```text\nPatient / record context:\n- Patient id: <known or omitted>\n- Main diagnoses / problems: <known facts only>\n- Recent symptoms or concerns: <known facts only>\n- Relevant labs / imaging / medications / visits: <known facts only>\n- Important uncertainties or missing data: <if relevant>\n\nQuestion for SLM:\n<one clear question about the patient health data stored in records>\n```\n\nGuidance:\n- Keep the final question focused and answerable.\n- Base it only on retrieved records or clearly stated conversation context.\n- Do not invent values, diagnoses, or history.\n- Prefer one strong question over several weak ones.\n- The calling agent should interpret the returned answer instead of relaying it blindly."},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/slm-inference/references/prompt-template.md\",\"content\":\"# Record-grounded SLM question template\\n\\nUse this shape when turning retrieved patient records into a focused question for the SLM.\\n\\n```text\\nPatient / record context:\\n- Patient id: <known or omitted>\\n- Main diagnoses / problems: <known facts only>\\n- Recent symptoms or concerns: <known facts only>\\n- Relevant labs / imaging / medications / visits: <known facts only>\\n- Important uncertainties or missing data: <if relevant>\\n\\nQuestion for SLM:\\n<one clear question about the patient health data stored in records>\\n```\\n\\nGuidance:\\n- Keep the final question focused and answerable.\\n- Base it only on retrieved records or clearly stated conversation context.\\n- Do not invent values, diagnoses, or history.\\n- Prefer one strong question over several weak ones.\\n- The calling agent should interpret the returned answer instead of relaying it blindly.\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":224,"output":232,"cacheRead":16256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16712,"cost":{"input":0.0005600000000000001,"output":0.00348,"cacheRead":0.004064,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008104}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774782967989}}
