{"type":"message","id":"c8db6463","parentId":"902748d6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:54:50.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Updated both files.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added an `slm-inference` section to `TOOLS.md`\n- Updated `slm-inference/SKILL.md` so it now explicitly states the SLM has expertise in:\n  - nephrology\n  - cardiology\n  - hypertension\n\nWhat it means:\n- The workspace guidance now points agents toward `slm-inference` for record-grounded kidney, cardiovascular, and blood-pressure-related reasoning\n- The skill itself now advertises the right scope and example question patterns\n\nNext sensible step:\n- If you want, I can also update the skill’s `references/prompt-template.md` so its examples explicitly include cardiology and hypertension prompts too.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a73fafca88252d0169c921177a3c8191886b0b96c39b7672\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":234,"output":151,"cacheRead":21120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21505,"cost":{"input":0.000585,"output":0.002265,"cacheRead":0.00528,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00813}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774788884527}}
